<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3mth, 6mth BUBOR rates ease, 1mth flat.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3mth, 6mth BUBOR rates ease, 1mth flat.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) eased on Friday day for the three and six-month maturities and was steady for one-month, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.51 percent, unchanged, the three-month rate at 20.03 percent, down 0.01, and the six-month rate at 19.69, down 0.01.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
